# Like trait-parent-body-change-3, with E's parent B in another project. With pipelining, Scala 3
# calls `dependencyPhaseCompleted` before it reports B. A change to a method body of E must not
# recompile F.

> use/compile
$ copy-file changes/E.scala use/E.scala
> use/compile
> use/checkRecompilations 0 F
